I never used a wish for a pet and I do not see a good reason to do
so. The pet may be powerful enough to take care of himself but the
player's char is still vulnerable to all nasty things, especially if
the pet is somewhere else on the level. In addition to this, the pet
may be easilest lost due to a level teleporter or a trap door which
